WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.139
In tutorial 1.9, you'll
sign in, confirm it's you,

00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:12.674
and choose a new password
if you forget yours.

00:00:13.714 --> 00:00:18.099
First, open the sign-in page, and type
your work e-mail and your password.

00:00:20.668 --> 00:00:23.427
Then click Sign in, and
your dashboard opens.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:29.844
Signed up with Google? Just click
Continue with Google instead.

00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:37.239
Does your company use single sign-on? Click
Sign in with SSO, type your work e-mail,

00:00:37.289 --> 00:00:38.559
and click Continue.

00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:43.964
If two-step verification is on,
you'll see Confirm it is you.

00:00:44.014 --> 00:00:49.202
Click Use a passkey, to confirm with this
device, your phone or a security key.

00:00:50.186 --> 00:00:54.286
Or click Use your authenticator
app, type the 6-digit code it shows,

00:00:54.336 --> 00:00:55.505
and click Sign in.

00:00:58.211 --> 00:01:02.656
No phone with you? Click Use a recovery
code instead, or Lost your phone?

00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:03.483
for help.

00:01:05.207 --> 00:01:08.917
Forgot your password? Click Forgot
password?, type your e-mail,

00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:10.557
and click Send reset link.

00:01:13.186 --> 00:01:17.236
Then check your inbox. The link we
send opens Choose a new password.

00:01:17.286 --> 00:01:19.715
Type a new one, and click Set password.

00:01:22.186 --> 00:01:27.014
Your password is changed. Click Sign in,
and use your new password from now on.

00:01:28.211 --> 00:01:33.161
So, sign in with your e-mail, Google
or single sign-on, confirm it's you,

00:01:33.211 --> 00:01:35.041
and reset a forgotten password.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.725
That's the Getting started series done.
Next, verify your website with Google,

00:01:40.775 --> 00:01:42.624
in tutorial 2.1.
